    robin "どうして？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2226
translate japanese story_beat6_4531aa45:

    # pro "I mean... you're already feeling anxious and stressed out about this, aren't you?"
    pro "つまり…あなたはすでにこのことで不安とストレスを感じていますよね？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2227
translate japanese story_beat6_eeb1fbd4:

    # pro "And that's not good. That's going to lead to an unhappy decision, regardless of which path you choose."
    pro "そして、それは良くありません。それは、あなたがどの道を選んだとしても、不幸な決断につながるでしょう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2228
translate japanese story_beat6_af6d63ea:

    # robin "But what else can I do..."
    robin "しかし、他に何ができるでしょうか..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2229
translate japanese story_beat6_1ed9ea77:

    # pro "Well, I think it's important for you to take the time to think things through."
    pro "そうですね、時間をかけてじっくり考えることが大切だと思います。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2230
translate japanese story_beat6_b672c8ca:

    # pro "Take the time to figure out what's best for you."
    pro "時間をかけて自分にとって何が最適かを考えてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2231
translate japanese story_beat6_b378fd1a:

    # pro "And... I want to help you with that, too."
    pro "そして...私もそれについてお手伝いしたいと思っています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2233
translate japanese story_beat6_0385e187:

    # robin "You do?"
    robin "あなたがやる？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2234
translate japanese story_beat6_9ac09d66:

    # pro "Of course..."
    pro "もちろん..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2235
translate japanese story_beat6_e65efcc8:

    # pro "Let me take care of you Robin."
    pro "ロビンさんのお世話をさせてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2236
translate japanese story_beat6_091d683a:

    # pro "Let me love you and show you how wonderful it can be."
    pro "あなたを愛して、それがどれほど素晴らしいかを教えてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2237
translate japanese story_beat6_3fd36189:

    # robin "B-but how?"
    robin "B、でもどうやって？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2239
translate japanese story_beat6_7c844f3d:

    # pro "You said you didn't want to have any more sex until we figured things out, right?"
    pro "状況がわかるまではもうセックスしたくないって言ってたよね？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2240
translate japanese story_beat6_a99ed122:

    # pro "That means you've already chosen your answer, haven't you?"
    pro "それはあなたがすでに答えを選んでいることを意味しますよね？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2241
translate japanese story_beat6_9f2551cd:

    # pro "You've just chosen the harder option to avoid taking a leap of faith."
    pro "あなたは、思い切って行動することを避けるために、より困難な選択肢を選択しただけです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2242
translate japanese story_beat6_9e97e6cb:

    # pro "But you need to understand that there are no right answers, only the answers that are right for us."
    pro "しかし、正しい答えはなく、私たちにとって正しい答えがあるだけであることを理解する必要があります。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2243
translate japanese story_beat6_190031a7:

    # pro "I'm not trying to pressure you into a relationship, but I think it would be good for both of us to give it a try."
    pro "あなたに関係を強要するつもりはありませんが、試してみるのはお互いにとって良いことだと思います。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2244
translate japanese story_beat6_93e9dc11:

    # pro "We can go as slow or as fast as you want, I'm not in a rush either."
    pro "ゆっくりでも早くでも構いません。私も急いでいません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2245
translate japanese story_beat6_46a65d19:

    # pro "But if you want to take a risk, and you want to try for a happy ending, then I think it's worth taking a leap of faith."
    pro "しかし、リスクを冒してハッピーエンドを目指したいのであれば、思い切って挑戦してみる価値はあると思います。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2246
translate japanese story_beat6_a1ba2e62:

    # pro "I'll catch you. I'll be there for you."
    pro "捕まえるよ。私があなたの側にいます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2247
translate japanese story_beat6_7bd462e9:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2248
translate japanese story_beat6_531cbf7d:

    # robin "Okay..."
    robin "わかった..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2249
translate japanese story_beat6_2920f75f:

    # pro "Okay?"
    pro "わかった？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2250
translate japanese story_beat6_5b527369:

    # pro "What's okay?"
    pro "何が大丈夫なの？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2252
translate japanese story_beat6_4b973700:

    # robin "Let's do it..."
    robin "やりましょう..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2253
translate japanese story_beat6_0a1bdcaf:

    # robin "I'm willing to try."
    robin "試してみたいと思います。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2254
translate japanese story_beat6_05d819c8:

    # robin "You're right. There's no use in worrying about it."
    robin "あなたが正しい。心配しても仕方ありません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2255
translate japanese story_beat6_79c95fa9:

    # robin "I just have to have a little courage."
    robin "少しだけ勇気があればいいのです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2256
translate japanese story_beat6_c5e6dd3b:

    # robin "If we're meant to be, we're meant to be, and if we're not then we can move on without hurting each other."
    robin "私たちがそうなるべきなら、私たちはそうなるべきだし、そうでないなら、お互いを傷つけずに先に進むことができます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2257
translate japanese story_beat6_7017fd2a:

    # pro "I'm so proud of you, Robin."
    pro "あなたをとても誇りに思います、ロビン。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2258
translate japanese story_beat6_84762869:

    # pro "This is a big step for you, and I'm glad that we can do this together."
    pro "これはあなたにとって大きな一歩であり、一緒にこれを達成できることを嬉しく思います。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2259
translate japanese story_beat6_78b2f91d:

    # robin "Yeah, it's kind of scary, but I'm excited."
    robin "そうですね、ちょっと怖いですけど、楽しみです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2260
translate japanese story_beat6_0c67d249:

    # robin "I've never been this close with someone before, it feels nice."
    robin "これまで誰かとこれほど親密になったことはありませんでした、とてもいい気分です。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2261
translate japanese story_beat6_17a73ef9:

    # "I still feel like he's unsure..."
    "彼はまだ迷っているような気がします..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2262
translate japanese story_beat6_e68f4459:

    # "Maybe he doesn't know how devoted I am to him... how much I want this to work."
    "たぶん彼は、私がどれだけ彼に献身的であるか...私がこれをどれだけうまくいきたいと思っているかを知らないのです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2263
translate japanese story_beat6_9fa56461:

    # "Maybe I should just..."
    "多分私はただ..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2265
translate japanese story_beat6_c282c949:

    # pro "Hey, Robin?"
    pro "ねえ、ロビン？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2267
translate japanese story_beat6_51813b74:

    # robin "Yeah?"
    robin "うん？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2268
translate japanese story_beat6_a59ba08c:

    # pro "I..."
    pro "私..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2269
translate japanese story_beat6_c29f95ca:

    # pro "I love-"
    pro "私は愛する-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2272
translate japanese story_beat6_2ebe7057:

    # "Before the words can leave my mouth, I hear a loud pounding on the front door."
    "その言葉が口から出る前に、玄関のドアを激しく叩く音が聞こえます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2273
translate japanese story_beat6_ffc4e12a:

    # robin "EEH!"
    robin "えー！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2274
translate japanese story_beat6_39166dcf:

    # pro "Who is that..."
    pro "それは誰ですか..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2276
translate japanese story_beat6_fe839abf:

    # "I go to the front door and check through the peephole."
    "玄関に行き、のぞき穴から中を確認します。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2277
translate japanese story_beat6_9dcd2c29:

    # pro "Hm, there's nobody there..."
    pro "うーん、誰もいない…。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2278
translate japanese story_beat6_195626ba:

    # robin "W-what..."
    robin "な、なんと..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2279
translate japanese story_beat6_a6aa8850:

    # pro "Weird..."
    pro "奇妙な..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2282
translate japanese story_beat6_bea6f56b:

    # "I open the door and look around, but there is nobody there."
    "ドアを開けて周囲を見回すが、誰もいない。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2283
translate japanese story_beat6_89a2d431:

    # robin "Whats that..."
    robin "あれは何でしょう..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2284
translate japanese story_beat6_e9143e8b:

    # "I look down and see a note."
    "下を見るとメモが見えます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2285
translate japanese story_beat6_7278c67b:

    # pro "What the fuck..."
    pro "なんてことだ..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2287
translate japanese story_beat6_d9773b9d:

    # "I bend down and pick it up."
    "かがんで拾います。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2288
translate japanese story_beat6_de8b4b67:

    # pro "This is..."
    pro "これは..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2289
translate japanese story_beat6_ef4d91be:

    # pro "A note addressed to Robin..."
    pro "ロビンに宛てたメモ…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2292
translate japanese story_beat6_989be03e:

    # "I open up the letter and begin to read it to Robin."
    "私は手紙を開いてロビンに読み聞かせ始めます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2295
translate japanese story_beat6_6e7b842b:

    # pro "'Dear my sweet Robin...'"
    pro "「親愛なる私の可愛いロビン…」"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2298
translate japanese story_beat6_26e005a4:

    # pro "'I'm sorry you felt frightened by me the last time we met...'"
    pro "「この前会った時は怖がらせてしまってごめんなさい…」"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2301
translate japanese story_beat6_12851fd8:

    # pro "'But you did not have to move so far from me.'"
    pro "「しかし、あなたは私からそんなに遠くに移動する必要はありませんでした。」"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2302
translate japanese story_beat6_9cf9d9f2:

    # robin "What the fuck."
    robin "なんてことだ。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2303
translate japanese story_beat6_ee0a8adf:

    # robin "This is from my stalker..."
    robin "これは私のストーカーからです..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2304
translate japanese story_beat6_20746ca0:

    # "I read the note some more..."
    "メモをもう少し読んでみたら…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2307
translate japanese story_beat6_82a7764b:

    # pro "'I miss you. I can't wait to see you in person again."
    pro "'私はあなたがいなくて寂しいです。また直接お会いできるのが待ちきれません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2310
translate japanese story_beat6_66605e06:

    # pro "'See you soon, my love.'"
    pro "「また会いましょう、愛する人。」"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2311
translate japanese story_beat6_004bff31:

    # pro "..."
    pro "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2314
translate japanese story_beat6_80de6757:

    # pro "Robin... are you alright?"
    pro "ロビン・・・大丈夫？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2315
translate japanese story_beat6_abe2461d:

    # "His eyes have gone wide, and tears are welling up in them."
    "彼の目は大きく見開かれ、その中には涙があふれ出ています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2316
translate japanese story_beat6_b5c2d783:

    # pro "Robin, it's alright. We can figure this out. He can't get in here. You're safe."
    pro "ロビン、大丈夫だよ。これはわかります。彼はここには入れません。安全です。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2317
translate japanese story_beat6_7123960c:

    # robin "Y-Yeah, I..."
    robin "そう、私は..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2318
translate japanese story_beat6_aca41591:

    # robin "I don't feel so safe..."
    robin "あまり安全な気がしません..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2319
translate japanese story_beat6_a67d8108:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "ロビン…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2320
translate japanese story_beat6_3e52ff82:

    # pro "Listen to me."
    pro "私の話を聞いて下さい。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2321
translate japanese story_beat6_f0ee89b1:

    # pro "We're going to be okay-"
    pro "大丈夫ですよ-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2322
translate japanese story_beat6_5fa99bcb:

    # robin "No... no we aren't."
    robin "いいえ...いいえ、そうではありません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2323
translate japanese story_beat6_4a2fdc82:

    # robin "Fuck fuck fuck..."
    robin "クソクソクソ..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2324
translate japanese story_beat6_71826702:

    # robin "I can't believe he found me."
    robin "彼が私を見つけたなんて信じられない。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2325
translate japanese story_beat6_8b0ab240:

    # robin "What if he breaks in..."
    robin "彼が侵入してきたらどうしよう..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2326
translate japanese story_beat6_a67d8108_1:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "ロビン…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2327
translate japanese story_beat6_feb1e3a4:

    # pro "Robin please calm down."
    pro "ロビン落ち着いてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2328
translate japanese story_beat6_39e86371:

    # pro "Listen to me..."
    pro "私の話を聞いて下さい..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2329
translate japanese story_beat6_f8c31f21:

    # pro "I know it's scary, and it feels like your whole world is crashing down around you."
    pro "怖いのはわかりますが、自分の世界全体が自分の周りで崩壊しているように感じます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2330
translate japanese story_beat6_6fc401e7:

    # pro "But I want you to take a deep breath, alright?"
    pro "でも、深呼吸してほしいんです、いいですか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2331
translate japanese story_beat6_010414c8:

    # pro "Take a deep breath..."
    pro "深呼吸してください..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2334
translate japanese story_beat6_38cebca3:

    # "Robin runs off into his room."
    "ロビンは自分の部屋に逃げ込みます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2335
translate japanese story_beat6_e3fec560:

    # pro "Robin!"
    pro "ロビン！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2338
translate japanese story_beat6_a49c57db:

    # "Robin slams the door shut."
    "ロビンはドアをバタンと閉めます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2339
translate japanese story_beat6_8a9c7539:

    # "Fuck, fuck..."
    "クソ、クソ..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2341
translate japanese story_beat6_05c2be62:

    # "I enter the room and see Robin in the corner of his room."
    "部屋に入ると、部屋の隅にロビンがいた。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2349
translate japanese story_beat6_a67d8108_2:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "ロビン…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2350
translate japanese story_beat6_5ed852ca:

    # robin "I knew it... I knew he would find me..."
    robin "分かってた...彼が私を見つけてくれるって分かってた..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2351
translate japanese story_beat6_2103d045:

    # robin "I knew this wouldn't last forever..."
    robin "これが永遠に続くわけではないことはわかっていました..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2352
translate japanese story_beat6_f4b2dcaa:

    # robin "Shit... what do I do."
    robin "くそ…どうしよう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2353
translate japanese story_beat6_ba0976e9:

    # robin "What do I do, [protagonist_name]?"
    robin "[protagonist_name] どうすればいいですか?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2354
translate japanese story_beat6_ba192134:

    # "His eyes are wide and full of terror. He is absolutely terrified."
    "彼の目は大きく見開かれ、恐怖に満ちています。彼は完全に怯えています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2355
translate japanese story_beat6_f558c877:

    # pro "We can't panic."
    pro "パニックにはなりません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2356
translate japanese story_beat6_26e40d21:

    # pro "It won't help us to panic. We have to be smart and rational. We have to figure this out together."
    pro "パニックになっても仕方がありません。私たちは賢く合理的でなければなりません。私たちはこれを一緒に解決しなければなりません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2357
translate japanese story_beat6_439defec:

    # robin "He's out there right now."
    robin "彼は今そこにいます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2358
translate japanese story_beat6_4b2e447b:

    # robin "I'm not safe anymore. He knows I live here."
    robin "もう安全ではありません。彼は私がここに住んでいることを知っています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2359
translate japanese story_beat6_8cca8499:

    # robin "I... I'm..."
    robin "私は...私は..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2360
translate japanese story_beat6_36b39d27:

    # robin "What do I do, I don't know what to do..."
    robin "どうしよう、どうすればいいのか分からない…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2361
translate japanese story_beat6_9272fe76:

    # "He's hyperventilating and crying now, tears streaming down his face."
    "彼は今、過呼吸になって泣いており、顔に涙が流れています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2362
translate japanese story_beat6_db1c1c53:

    # robin "This is it..."
    robin "これです..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2363
translate japanese story_beat6_b25b158e:

    # robin "This is my nightmare come to life."
    robin "これは私の悪夢が現実になったものです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2364
translate japanese story_beat6_5f766436:

    # pro "No, no... It's okay Robin... You're okay."
    pro "いや、いや…大丈夫だよロビン…大丈夫だよ。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2365
translate japanese story_beat6_019a028f:

    # pro "Everything will be okay."
    pro "すべてうまくいきます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2366
translate japanese story_beat6_d80dce47:

    # pro "You just need to calm down, and we can figure this out together, okay?"
    pro "落ち着いてください。一緒に解決しましょう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2367
translate japanese story_beat6_c88bfd60:

    # pro "I'm not going to let anything happen to you, Robin. I'll make sure of it, no matter what. I'll protect you."
    pro "あなたに何も起こらないようにします、ロビン。何があっても必ず確認します。私があなたを守ります。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2368
translate japanese story_beat6_18279255:

    # robin "I... I'm not safe. I need to get out of here."
    robin "私は...安全ではありません。ここから出なければなりません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2369
translate japanese story_beat6_d596803f:

    # robin "I need to leave."
    robin "出発しなければなりません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2370
translate japanese story_beat6_6ae8dd1a:

    # robin "I need to go somewhere else where nobody knows where I am. I can't stay here."
    robin "私がどこにいるのか誰も知らないどこか別の場所に行かなければなりません。ここにはいられない。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2371
translate japanese story_beat6_3770b669:

    # robin "What if he breaks in?"
    robin "彼が侵入したらどうなるでしょうか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2372
translate japanese story_beat6_1737112b:

    # robin "What if he tries to do something to me while I'm asleep?"
    robin "私が寝ている間に彼が私に何かをしようとしたらどうしますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2373
translate japanese story_beat6_94c00a1e:

    # "Fuck, he's spiraling again."
    "クソ、彼はまたスパイラルに陥っている。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2374
translate japanese story_beat6_b734da46:

    # robin "No, no... I have to leave now, I can't be here any longer..."
    robin "いや、いや…もう帰らなきゃいけない、もうここにはいられない…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2375
translate japanese story_beat6_ea0366dc:

    # pro "Robin, no... listen to me."
    pro "ロビン、いや…聞いてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2376
translate japanese story_beat6_03464c09:

    # pro "You're panicking."
    pro "パニックになっていますね。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2377
translate japanese story_beat6_e61d5a28:

    # pro "You can't let fear dictate what you do, that's what will get you hurt."
    pro "恐怖に自分の行動を左右されてはいけません。それがあなたを傷つけることになります。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2378
translate japanese story_beat6_c10f49fe:

    # robin "But..."
    robin "しかし..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2379
translate japanese story_beat6_f2814e5d:

    # robin "I don't want to be hurt. I'm scared. I'm so scared..."
    robin "傷つきたくないんです。私は怖いです。とても怖いです..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2380
translate japanese story_beat6_91b09236:

    # pro "Do you trust me, Robin?"
    pro "ロビン、私を信じますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2381
translate japanese story_beat6_8dc8bc96:

    # robin "W-what?"
    robin "な、何？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2382
translate japanese story_beat6_6c37f246:

    # pro "Do you trust me? Can you trust me with this?"
    pro "私を信じますか？これで私を信用してもらえますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2383
translate japanese story_beat6_57cad898:

    # robin "I trust you, but I'm not sure I trust myself..."
    robin "私はあなたを信じていますが、自分自身を信じているかどうかはわかりません..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2384
translate japanese story_beat6_c3135f5b:

    # robin "I can't think clearly... I don't want to make the wrong decision, but I don't know what to do..."
    robin "明確に考えることができない…間違った決断をしたくないけど、どうすればいいのか分からない…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2385
translate japanese story_beat6_3567a5c6:

    # pro "Then follow my lead. Do what I do, and you'll be alright."
    pro "それなら私の先導に従ってください。私がすることをやれば大丈夫です。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2386
translate japanese story_beat6_0c1aa26a:

    # robin "But I don't want you to get hurt... or worse..."
    robin "でも、あなたには怪我をしてほしくないんです..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2387
translate japanese story_beat6_89568f5e:

    # robin "I'm scared."
    robin "私は怖いです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2388
translate japanese story_beat6_a9628e64:

    # pro "We're not going to get hurt. I promise."
    pro "私たちは怪我をするつもりはありません。約束します。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2389
translate japanese story_beat6_b5e5cee4:

    # robin "You can't guarantee that... no one can."
    robin "それを保証することはできません...誰も保証できません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2390
translate japanese story_beat6_e7f591e1:

    # robin "I need to go somewhere he won't find me, and then maybe we'll be safe."
    robin "彼に見つからない場所に行かなければ、たぶん私たちは安全になれるだろう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2391
translate japanese story_beat6_dc6dc9d0:

    # "I have to make a decision, I have to say something."
    "決断しなければならないし、何かを言わなければなりません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2392
translate japanese story_beat6_43db7b2c:

    # "Until I make a choice for Robin, he'll continue to spiral."
    "私がロビンのために選択をするまで、彼はスパイラルを続けるだろう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2447
translate japanese story_beat6_ec012af7:

    # "What should I do?"
    "どうすればいいですか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2459
translate japanese ending1_6f18e46b:

    # pro "Robin, listen to me."
    pro "ロビン、聞いてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2460
translate japanese ending1_56251f37:

    # pro "I'll confront him, if he even steps a foot near you I'll kick his fucking ass."
    pro "私は彼に立ち向かう、もし彼があなたの近くに足を踏み入れたなら、私は彼のクソ尻を蹴ります。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2461
translate japanese ending1_30fd2c14:

    # pro "I'm done letting this stupid stalker psychologically torture you like this."
    pro "この愚かなストーカーにこのようにあなたを精神的に拷問させるのはもう終わりです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2462
translate japanese ending1_fd1949ec:

    # pro "Let's take this fucker down."
    pro "この野郎を倒しましょう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2463
translate japanese ending1_b3d003e8:

    # pro "If anything, this could be an opportunity."
    pro "どちらかといえば、これはチャンスかもしれません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2464
translate japanese ending1_26bad9f7:

    # pro "We could set a trap, bait him into making the first move, and get the police involved."
    pro "罠を仕掛け、彼を誘導して最初の行動をとらせ、警察を介入させることもできます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2465
translate japanese ending1_75bfb15e:

    # robin "What..."
    robin "何..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2466
translate japanese ending1_7ad18170:

    # pro "Don't you want him to face justice? Don't you want him to rot away in a cell for being such a scumbag?"
    pro "彼に正義の裁きを受けてほしくないですか？こんな最低な奴だから独房で朽ち果ててほしくないのか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2467
translate japanese ending1_60ca6eb5:

    # robin "I... I want to forget he ever existed and hope I never see his face again."
    robin "私は...彼が存在したことを忘れたい、そして二度と彼の顔を見ないことを望みます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2468
translate japanese ending1_697e8cb8:

    # pro "I know you do, but if you just run away from it..."
    pro "それはわかってるけど、そこから逃げてしまったら…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2469
translate japanese ending1_fa132311:

    # pro "It will always be looming over your head. And it will always have its hooks in you, tugging at you, tormenting you."
    pro "それは常にあなたの頭上に迫ってくるでしょう。そして、それは常にあなたの中に引っ掛かり、あなたを引っ張り、苦しめるでしょう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2470
translate japanese ending1_cd0fa110:

    # robin "But... I'm so afraid. I can barely even imagine facing him alone."
    robin "でも...とても怖いです。彼と一人で対峙するなんて想像もできません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2471
translate japanese ending1_a38acf0f:

    # pro "You're not alone."
    pro "あなたは一人ではありません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2472
translate japanese ending1_507739f8:

    # pro "I'm here, always."
    pro "私はいつもここにいます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2473
translate japanese ending1_d55454f1:

    # pro "I'm here to support you."
    pro "私はあなたをサポートするためにここにいます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2474
translate japanese ending1_0cc141e3:

    # pro "I'm here to take care of you."
    pro "あなたの世話をするためにここにいます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2475
translate japanese ending1_7bd462e9:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2476
translate japanese ending1_5a1b7040:

    # pro "We need to act fast, Robin."
    pro "急いで行動する必要がある、ロビン。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2477
translate japanese ending1_4545a33b:

    # robin "I don't know... I just don't know. What if I regret it?"
    robin "分かりません...ただ分かりません。後悔したらどうしますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2478
translate japanese ending1_9a052b3a:

    # pro "Do you trust me?"
    pro "私を信じますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2479
translate japanese ending1_80617602:

    # robin "Yes, but I'm worried you'll do something stupid or reckless or—"
    robin "はい、でも私はあなたが何か愚かなことや無謀なことをするのではないかと心配しています、あるいは—"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2480
translate japanese ending1_06295e90:

    # pro "Robin."
    pro "ロビン。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2481
translate japanese ending1_7c8ad6f4:

    # pro "We're partners. You and me. Partners. And we're stronger together than apart."
    pro "私たちはパートナーです。あなたと私。パートナー。そして、私たちは離れているよりも一緒にいる方が強いのです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2482
translate japanese ending1_7bd462e9_1:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2486
translate japanese ending1_1063c74c:

    # "Robin gets off the floor."
    "ロビンは床から降りる。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2487
translate japanese ending1_b3874a90:

    # robin "Alright, but if I die, I'm gonna haunt your ass as a ghost for the rest of eternity."
    robin "わかったけど、もし私が死んだら、幽霊として永遠にあなたのお尻につきまとうことになるよ。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2488
translate japanese ending1_f370dd4f:

    # pro "Deal. Let's do this."
    pro "取引。これをやってみましょう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2490
translate japanese ending1_47b08dfb:

    # "Robin has a smile on his face again."
    "ロビンはまた笑顔を取り戻した。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2492
translate japanese ending1_2a5a7ba2:

    # robin "So, what's the plan?"
    robin "それで、計画は何ですか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2494
translate japanese ending1_ef66c50c:

    # pro "This creep clearly knows you're with someone."
    pro "この不気味な奴は、あなたが誰かと一緒にいるのを明らかに知っています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2495
translate japanese ending1_f8e4eb3d:

    # pro "He's just waiting for an opportunity where you're alone before striking, that's when he has power."
    pro "彼は攻撃する前にあなたが一人になる機会を待っているだけであり、そのときが彼に力があるときです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2496
translate japanese ending1_d02d9c8c:

    # pro "Given that he was able to disappear after leaving the note, that means he is still somewhere near the building."
    pro "彼がメモを残した後に姿を消すことができたことを考えると、彼はまだ建物の近くのどこかにいることを意味します。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2497
translate japanese ending1_191b0d03:

    # pro "He may even be inside our apartment building, even now."
    pro "彼は今でも私たちのアパートの中にいるかもしれません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2498
translate japanese ending1_7bd462e9_2:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2499
translate japanese ending1_999e07c6:

    # pro "Hey, don't worry. He won't do anything until he knows you're alone and defenseless."
    pro "やあ、心配しないで。あなたが一人で無防備であることがわかるまで、彼は何もしません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2500
translate japanese ending1_5261baf4:

    # pro "So here's my plan."
    pro "それで、これが私の計画です。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2501
translate japanese ending1_e482a287:

    # pro "Tonight, when it gets late, turn on your stream and pretend that I'm out of the house."
    pro "今夜、遅くなったら、ストリームをオンにして、私が家から出ているふりをしてください。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2502
translate japanese ending1_69415f3e:

    # pro "If he's watching, this will be his chance to strike."
    pro "彼が見ているなら、これは攻撃のチャンスだ。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2503
translate japanese ending1_e561669b:

    # pro "At least he'll think so."
    pro "少なくとも彼はそう思うだろう。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2504
translate japanese ending1_8b3a9809:

    # pro "I'll hide somewhere and wait for him to appear."
    pro "どこかに隠れて彼が現れるのを待ちます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2505
translate japanese ending1_133bc4d3:

    # pro "I'll also call the cops and have them on stand-by."
    pro "警察にも電話して待機させます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2506
translate japanese ending1_7a146a6d:

    # robin "That sounds so dangerous..."
    robin "それはとても危険な気がします..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2507
translate japanese ending1_7498e563:

    # robin "What if he hurts you?"
    robin "彼があなたを傷つけたらどうしますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2508
translate japanese ending1_cc02856f:

    # pro "Trust me, I may look a bit scrawny but I can take care of myself."
    pro "信じてください、私は少し痩せているように見えるかもしれませんが、自分の世話はできます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2509
translate japanese ending1_4585dad3:

    # robin "I hope so..."
    robin "そうだといい..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2510
translate japanese ending1_3aa0a0fc:

    # pro "Once he shows up, I'll confront him and subdue him."
    pro "彼が現れたら、私は彼に立ち向かい、彼を鎮圧します。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2511
translate japanese ending1_53335d30:

    # pro "And the cops can swoop in to finish the job."
    pro "そして、警察が急襲して仕事を終わらせることができます。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2512
translate japanese ending1_12bd033e:

    # robin "This feels like a weird dream, I can't believe this is happening..."
    robin "変な夢を見ているような気がする、こんなことが起こるなんて信じられない…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2513
translate japanese ending1_8ebc34c4:

    # pro "It's the only way. Otherwise, he'll never leave you alone."
    pro "それが唯一の方法です。そうでなければ、彼は決してあなたを放っておくことはありません。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2514
translate japanese ending1_55929a4f:

    # robin "But what if he-"
    robin "しかし、もし彼が-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2515
translate japanese ending1_06295e90_1:

    # pro "Robin."
    pro "ロビン。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2516
translate japanese ending1_9a052b3a_1:

    # pro "Do you trust me?"
    pro "私を信じますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2517
translate japanese ending1_7bd462e9_3:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2518
translate japanese ending1_fdda3cea:

    # robin "Yes, I do."
    robin "はい、そうします。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2519
translate japanese ending1_2ca947ca:

    # pro "I promise, it will be over after this."
    pro "約束します、これで終わりです。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2520
translate japanese ending1_87a28495:

    # pro "I... I love you Robin."
    pro "私は…ロビンを愛しています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2521
translate japanese ending1_5e0e9a4c:

    # robin "...!"
    robin "...!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2522
translate japanese ending1_13bbb172:

    # robin "L... love?"
    robin "L...愛？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2523
translate japanese ending1_7c6b9782:

    # robin "You... you love me?"
    robin "あなたは...あなたは私を愛していますか？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2524
translate japanese ending1_607d3540:

    # pro "Yes, I love you."
    pro "はい、愛しています。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2525
translate japanese ending1_9b86348a:

    # pro "You're the most amazing person I've ever met. I would do anything to protect you, Robin."
    pro "あなたは私が今まで会った中で最も素晴らしい人です。あなたを守るためなら何でもします、ロビン。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2526
translate japanese ending1_fae21aec:

    # robin "I... I..."
    robin "私は...私は..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2528
translate japanese ending1_f9a80488:

    # "I can see the fear in his eyes slowly turning into determination."
    "彼の目には恐怖が徐々に決意へと変わっていくのがわかります。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2529
translate japanese ending1_156df43e:

    # robin "I trust you, but I'm also scared..."
    robin "信じてるけど、怖さもある…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2530
translate japanese ending1_3114db35:

    # robin "Above all else, I want this to end."
    robin "何よりもこれを終わらせたい。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2531
